    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63702" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογ-εῖον</span></b> , τό, (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογεύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1
				</span></i>
			) prop. <i>speaking-place</i>: in the theatre, <i>stage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				11(2).161
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>D</u>
				126
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				5.7.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Thes.</u>
				16
			</span></i>, etc.: generally, <i>platform,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arch.Pap.
				2.564
			</span></i> (pl.), unless <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογείων</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογίων</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόμα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.98
			</span></i>.</div>
